subgraph PROXY["Proxy/network helpers"]
  FWD[forwarder.exe]:::helper
  PPX[Default.ppx + Proxifier]:::helper
  PSTATE[forwarder*.txt/json
proxy*.txt/lock]:::data
end

LOGIN --> FWD
PROXYTAB --> FWD
FAST --> FWD
FWD ==> PPX
PSTATE -. data .-> FWD
PPX ==> GAME

